  "display_title": "Proxy Game",
  "description": "Do-Yoon struggles through his days, paying weekly tuition to his classmate, Yu-Chan. One day, he receives an indie game from a developer he met online. He's shocked to discover the game's protagonist is in the same predicament as himself. Partly out of curiosity, partly out of hope, he chooses to take brutal revenge on Yu-Chan, who has been tormenting him. The next day, Do-Yoon's daily life begins to mirror the game... \n\nThe suspicious game, however, changes his life entirely, its choices transforming him into a game of his own.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
